Source: osiris-desktop-theme
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OSIRIS <osiris@example.org>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 make,
 jq,
 python3,
 python3-pil,
 librsvg2-bin,
 fonts-firacode,
 grub-common,
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/richardblaha/osiris-themes
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: osiris-theme-gtk
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-prefs
Description: OSIRIS dual-accent GTK 3/4 + GNOME Shell theme
 Cyan/rose colour theme for GTK 3, GTK 4 / libadwaita and GNOME Shell, matching
 the OSIRIS design system (docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md). Ships the "Osiris" (dark) and
 "Osiris-Light" theme variants plus the `osiris-gtk-theme` helper that wires up
 the libadwaita opt-in drop-in.

Package: osiris-theme-plasma
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qt5-style-kvantum, qt6-style-kvantum
Description: OSIRIS dual-accent KDE Plasma / Qt theme
 Plasma colour schemes (Osiris / Osiris Light), Kvantum Qt themes
 (OsirisDark / OsirisLight), the OsirisDark Aurorae window decoration and the
 "Osiris" Plasma desktop theme.

Package: osiris-theme-grub
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, grub-common
Description: OSIRIS graphical GRUB2 boot theme
 1920x1080 boot menu in the OSIRIS visual language — Fira Code, cyan selection,
 rose countdown bar, generated boot-menu icons. The post-install hook copies the
 theme into /boot/grub, sets GRUB_THEME and regenerates grub.cfg.

Package: osiris-wallpapers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OSIRIS wallpapers (Abstract Bloom + Ancient Egypt Sci-Fi)
 Fixed Day/Night renders at 4 resolutions plus GNOME time-of-day dynamic XML and
 KDE Plasma light/dark wallpaper packages. Installed under
 /usr/share/backgrounds/osiris.

Package: osiris-desktop-theme
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 osiris-theme-gtk (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-theme-plasma (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-theme-grub (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-wallpapers (= ${source:Version}),
Description: OSIRIS desktop theme (metapackage)
 Pulls in every OSIRIS theme component: GTK/GNOME, KDE Plasma/Qt, the GRUB boot
 theme and the wallpapers.
